  "description": "Optional Iwxxm.Net add-on that runs the complete, unmodified official WMO IWXXM 2025-2 Schematron (iwxxm.sch, queryBinding xslt2, all 165 rules) with SaxonCS-HE (MPL-2.0) and the vendored SchXslt 1.10.1 compiler (MIT). Code-list lookups resolve to the official WMO RDF files embedded in Iwxxm.Net; no network or file-system access at runtime. Register with IwxxmParserBuilder.UseOfficialSchematron().",
